senders (required): list of sender identifiers to trash all mail from — can be email addresses (e.g. "noreply@ziprecruiter.com") or display names (e.g. "Cuts Clothing", "ZipRecruiter"); display names are matched as phrases against the From header
extra_query: optional additional Gmail query clause to narrow scope, e.g. "before:2024/01/01" — combined with each sender filter
max_per_sender: integer; always use 1000 (tool enforces this hard cap per sender)
account_id: optional; canonical value is exactly "google_user_primary" — do not abbreviate or alter this value
